ce"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔菲帕","text":"[show]你不用劝我。虽然我很记仇，但我也不是那么蛮不讲理。[r]我只是没法接受在你面前出丑罢了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara045_1_face_chara045_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔菲帕","text":"[show]啊，原来是这样啊。哼……我明白了。[r]既然上天故意让我在你面前出洋相，就是在和我明目张胆地作对。真有意思。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara045_1_face_chara045_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔菲帕","text":"[show]好啊。那就来看看是谁更厉害！[r]雷鸣啊，汇集此处吧！五、雷、轰、顶——[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":220,"mirrow":false,"y":-154,"img":"chara045_1","addImg":"chara045_1_face_chara045_1b"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[show]（突然天空乌云密布，无数雷鸣在云中响起。你慌忙制止了艾尔菲帕，解释无论怎么样你都会支持她。）[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"艾尔菲帕-亲密3","script":"yd_045_09"}